<title>JAPAN: Zexel files 30 bln yen shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Zexel files 30 bln yen shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zexel Corp said on Wednesday it had filed a shelf registration with the Finance Ministry to issue up to 30 billion yen worth of corporate bonds, effective for two years from May 20.</p>
</text>
